04:16.560 --> 04:19.960
balance competing project constraints and the big ones.

04:20.100 --> 04:22.960
You have scope quality schedule.

04:23.040 --> 04:28.770
The cost of the budget the resources physical and human and risk.

04:28.800 --> 04:31.590
So those are competing project constraints.

04:31.590 --> 04:37.260
Typically we think of the iron triangle though that you think of time cost and scope that those are

04:37.260 --> 04:38.680
